## User

The longest word of a string of words separated by spaces; on a tie, the first such word.

## Type

type
```haskell
longestWord :: String -> String
```

## Term

```haskell
longestWord = go []
  where
    go acc [] = acc
    go acc (x:xs) = go (x:acc) xs
```

